summary: Jobs for non-root users run in their systemd user manager
description: |
    Exercises the exact systemd-run invocation the executor builds for a
    non-root job (internal/executor Systemd.Args) on a real systemd:
    the job runs as the user, systemctl --user and rootless podman work,
    exit codes come through, and stopping the outer unit stops the inner.
test: ./test.sh
duration: 10m
require:
  - systemd
  - podman
